(Invoice Processing Guide) Tj T*
(Xinglan Technology Co., Ltd. - Finance Operations / Accounts Payable) Tj T*
(Version 3.2 - Effective 1 April 2025) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Scope) Tj T*
(This guide describes how accounts payable processes vendor invoices for goods and) Tj T*
(services purchased against a purchase order. Employee expense claims are handled by) Tj T*
(the expense policy and are out of scope here.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Submission window) Tj T*
(Invoices must be submitted through the AP portal within 45 days of the invoice date.) Tj T*
(Invoices received after the 45-day window are returned to the vendor and must be) Tj T*
(re-issued with a current invoice date. The portal accepts PDF files up to 10 MB;) Tj T*
(scanned images without a text layer are rejected automatically.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Required fields) Tj T*
(Every invoice must state the vendor legal name, invoice number, invoice date,) Tj T*
(purchase order number, subtotal, tax amount, total amount and the six-digit cost) Tj T*
(center. An invoice without a purchase order number is placed on hold until a) Tj T*
(matching PO is created. Holds longer than 15 business days are escalated to the) Tj T*
(finance controller.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Approval matrix) Tj T*
(Invoices under USD 1,000 are approved by the team lead.) Tj T*
(Invoices from USD 1,000 to USD 10,000 are approved by the department head.) Tj T*
(Invoices above USD 10,000 require approval from the CFO.) Tj T*
(Approval must be completed within 5 business days, otherwise the request is) Tj T*
(re-assigned to the next level in the matrix.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Every approved invoice keeps an audit trail: approver name, timestamp and the) Tj T*
(purchase order it was matched against.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Payment terms) Tj T*
(The standard payment term is Net 30 from the approval date, not from the invoice) Tj T*
(date. A 2% early payment discount applies when an approved invoice is paid within) Tj T*
(10 days of approval. Payments are executed every Tuesday and Thursday through the) Tj T*
(banking partner.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Vendors requesting a change of bank details must submit a signed form; the change) Tj T*
(takes effect only after a callback verification by the treasury team.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Duplicate invoices) Tj T*
(The system detects a duplicate when the vendor name and the invoice number both) Tj T*
(match an existing record, regardless of amount or submission date. Duplicates are) Tj T*
ET
endstream
