(blocked automatically and listed in the weekly exception report for the AP manager.) Tj T*
(Re-submitting a blocked invoice never creates a second record.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Currency and exchange rates) Tj T*
(Foreign currency invoices are converted at the exchange rate published on the) Tj T*
(invoice date. A tolerance of 1.5% is allowed for rate differences; anything above) Tj T*
(that requires a written explanation attached to the invoice record.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. Late payment) Tj T*
(Overdue invoices accrue interest at 0.05% per day, counted from the day after the) Tj T*
(due date. Interest is paid only when the delay is caused by the company, not when) Tj T*
(the vendor submitted incomplete documents.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. Exceptions) Tj T*
(Prepaid expenses are handled by the expense policy. Questions about a specific) Tj T*
(invoice should be raised as an AP ticket and are answered within one business day.) Tj T*
ET
